   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">maybe you should try <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">color = NULL</code> to disable drawing cell borders. It seems that the color we can see on the plot are all ‘purple` that you specifying for the cell border.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj5tYXliZSB5b3Ugc2hvdWxkIHRyeSBgY29sb3IgPSBOVUxMYCB0byBkaXNhYmxlIGRyYXdp\r\nbmcgY2VsbCBib3JkZXJzLiBJdCBzZWVtcyB0aGF0IHRoZSBjb2xvciB3ZSBjYW4gc2VlIG9uIHRo\r\nZSBwbG90IGFyZSBhbGwgJ3B1cnBsZWAgdGhhdCB5b3Ugc3BlY2lmeWluZyBmb3IgdGhlIGNlbGwg\r\nYm9yZGVyLjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2Pg==\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Jul 12, 2018 at 4:14 PM, Yu, Guangchuang <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gc...@connect.hku.hk</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>any reproducible example? If you want to keep your data confidential, you can send the file to me instead of posting on the group.</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Jul 11, 2018 at 6:11 PM, Breanna Sipley <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">breanna...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi there,<div><br></div><div>I have a circular tree &amp; presence/absence data for each tip.  I would like to map this data onto my tree.  </div><div><br></div><div>I have followed the tutorial at <a href=\"https://rgriff23.github.io/2017/05/11/primate-phylogeny-ggtree.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rgriff23.github.io/2017/05/11/primate-phylogeny-ggtree.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482493535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gpSRzwhQwWaQulB9kUO9G\">https://rgriff23.github.io/2017/05/11/primate-phylogeny-ggtree.html</a> &amp; have seen <a href=\"https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/ggtree/issues/78#issuecomment-252172314\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/ggtree/issues/78%23issuecomment-252172314&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482493535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24arAMWSBe8nY2RUFMBHBq\">https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/ggtree/issues/78#issuecomment-252172314</a>, but am still having problems.  </div><div><br></div><div>It seems my code generates the skeleton of the map but does not successfully populate it. </div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s my code:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#000000\"><div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">tree </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tree.tre&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dd </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">csv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data.txt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;\\t&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tipLabel&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dat&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                header </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                stringsAsFactors </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> subset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tipLabel </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tree$tip</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$dat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ifelse</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;YES&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;present&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;absent&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>row</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL<br><br>circ </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;circular&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;none&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>p </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gheatmap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">circ</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dat&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> offset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              low</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;salmon&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">high</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;purple&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  scale_fill_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;salmon&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;black&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  coord_polar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">theta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;y&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)<br></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>png</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;error.png&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dev</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">off</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()<br><br></span></div></code></div></div></code></div></div></div></font></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Which returns this:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GFxMRXs_emI/W0XXaDjkOKI/AAAAAAAABO4/o3Y4_zJpHZ4U6xSfDayauu0nlakQ3U8xQCLcBGAs/s1600/error.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GFxMRXs_emI/W0XXaDjkOKI/AAAAAAAABO4/o3Y4_zJpHZ4U6xSfDayauu0nlakQ3U8xQCLcBGAs/s1600/error.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482493536000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2OyV9kKSZJY3HgxciFhg_v\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GFxMRXs_emI/W0XXaDjkOKI/AAAAAAAABO4/o3Y4_zJpHZ4U6xSfDayauu0nlakQ3U8xQCLcBGAs/s320/error.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"320\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div>Some more info:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># I&#39;m pretty sure I&#39;ve set up my dataframe ok</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dat&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      dat<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> present<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  absent<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> present<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  absent<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  absent<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  absent<br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Data consists of &quot;present&quot; or &quot;absent&quot; only </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">factor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> absent present <br>     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">88</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">185</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># There&#39;s a 1:1 between my tips &amp; binary data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$tipLabel </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tree$tip</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Mode</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    TRUE <br>logical     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">273<br><br></span></div></code></div></div></code></div></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Any advice?</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Breanna</div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nG Yu, DK Smith, H Zhu, Y Guan, TTY Lam*. ggtree: an R package for visualization and annotation of phylogenetic trees with their covariates and other associated data, Methods in Ecology and Evolution, 2017, 8(1):28-36. doi:10.1111/2041-210X.12628<br>\r\n <br>\r\nHomepage: <a href=\"https://guangchuangyu.github.io/software/ggtree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://guangchuangyu.github.io/software/ggtree&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482493536000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36wBofsWzJWD4HhcRNwV5c\">https://guangchuangyu.github.io/software/ggtree</a><br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;